ures of our industries  that it often pays you not to be an  artist it pays you to conform to conform  to leave your wicked dirty bad  subconscious at the door let's face it  if your thoughts were not wicked and  scary you would not be writers I very  much enjoyed your scripts and admired  them and I envied them and I also envied  of course that they are already written  but now with affection I want to invite  you I want to challenge you to stay  writers that doesn't mean you can't or  shouldn't take work where you can to  exercise your considerable skills in the  pursuit of money for buying a house or  raising children or buying emergency  items like Manolos or Laker tickets but  every now and then remember the spirit  in which these scripts were written some  of the best movies in history were  written like that alone in the night for  no money and with this thing a horrible  smelly winged creature sitting on your  shoulder whispering nobody cares a lot  of people care believe me a lot of the  best people care so I beg you stay  artists
 

